<!-- PRACTICAL 8                                -->
<!-- ========================================== -->
<h2>Practical 8: MySQL Schema Design, ER Model & Database Connectivity</h2>
<p><strong>Problem Definition:</strong> Design normalized relational tables for StudentHub (<code>users</code>, <code>students</code>, <code>events</code>, <code>registrations</code>, <code>audit_logs</code>) and create a centralized PHP database connection file using PDO and MySQLi.</p>

<h3>1. Database Schema Table Overview:</h3>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Table Name</th><th>Primary Key</th><th>Foreign Keys / Indexes</th><th>Key Columns</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td><code>users</code></td><td>user_id</td><td>UNIQUE(email)</td><td>name, email, password, role ('admin','student')</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>students</code></td><td>student_id</td><td>UNIQUE(email)</td><td>name, email, mobile, department, semester</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>events</code></td><td>event_id</td><td>INDEX(event_date)</td><td>event_name, event_date, venue, poster_path</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>registrations</code></td><td>registration_id</td><td>FK(student_id), FK(event_id)</td><td>student_id, event_id, registration_date</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>audit_logs</code></td><td>log_id</td><td>INDEX(user_id)</td><td>user_id, action, details, ip_address, created_at</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h3>2. Database Connection Script (db.php):</h3>
<div class="code-box">&lt;?php
$host = "localhost";
$dbname = "studenthub";
$username = "root";
$password = "";

try {
  $pdo = new PDO("mysql:host=$host;dbname=$dbname;charset=utf8mb4", $username, $password);
  $pdo-&gt;setAttribute(PDO::ATTR_ERRMODE, PDO::ERRMODE_EXCEPTION);
  $pdo-&gt;setAttribute(PDO::ATTR_DEFAULT_FETCH_MODE, PDO::FETCH_ASSOC);
} catch (PDOException $e) {
  die("Database connection failed: " . $e-&gt;getMessage());
}
?&gt;</div>

